WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club

﻿1

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:09.209
<i>The world of Altera is
about to change.</i>


00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.604
<i>Altera is a land divided
among humans, elves,</i>


00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.929
<i>and beasts and dragons.</i>


00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:22.126
<i>Decades ago, the elves and humans
drove the beasts and dragons</i>


00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:24.521
<i>back into the dark mountains.</i>


00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:31.809
<i>Evil thrives on darkness
and draws strength from it.</i>


00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:37.683
<i>Rage and fury gathers in the gem
possessed by the Black Dragon,</i>


00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.043
<i>waiting for the dragon to reawaken.</i>


00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>In recent years, human and elves
have been fighting for territory,</i>


00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:55.287
<i>and because of this
they cannot see the common enemy</i>


00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.370
<i>and the greater evil coming their way.</i>


00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.369
<i>But Nerwin the elf princess
can see the growing storm</i>


00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:06.927
<i>and thinks Altera's only hope
is to forget the past</i>


00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.929
<i>and ally with the humans.</i>


00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:13.170
<i>She has decided
to act on her own, in secret.</i>


00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:16.841
<i>Courageous, but foolish.</i>


00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:21.966
- There's something here. I sense it.
- Humans? We're still in elf territory.


00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:24.208
No one knows our plan.


00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:29.004
What?


00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:55.006
Huh?


00:01:55.160 --> 00:02:00.371
Why do you even try?
Your skills are no match for mine.


00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:04.451
- Princess Elena!
- Princess Elena? How did she find us?


00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:11.968
So, you're Liya. You should join me.
Soon I will be the ruler of Altera.


00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:17.727
- It's time for elves to rule.
- Close your mind to her.


00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:20.969
- She can enchant.
- Nerwin, beware.


00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:24.846
The beasts are on the move
and the Black Dragon will wake soon.


00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:30.162
You want an alliance with the humans?
That's charming, but pathetic.


00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:34.171
I have a plan.
Soon I will rule this world.


00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:37.250
It's time for elves to rule.


00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:59.001
Mm, chicken leg. Time to eat.


00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:01.885
Ow!


00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.405
Beasts?


00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:10.170
Not me! Not me!


00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.608
Whoa, real beasts.


00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:21.362
Destroy. Destroy. Burn.


00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:25.769
- Kill!
- Lunch is postponed.


00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:27.609
- Human meat.
- Roast them all.


00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:30.486
- Hungry.
- Hungry.


00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.090
I must beat them to Carderock.


00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:41.441
- Human!
- Nice to meet you too! Bye!


00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:44.769
- That way!
- Get him!


00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:56.851
There!


00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:27.130
Human!


00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:36.209
Jump!


00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:40.124
This is not good.


00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:49.201
Situation not improving.


00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:22.609
This is not my day.


00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.206
Uh-oh.


00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:29.960
- Trapped! Eat raw.
- Tasty meat.


00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:35.405
Food? You want food? I have
a chicken leg. This is really tasty.


00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:39.007
No! Eat human. You food!


00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:43.370
So good! Arm! Wing!


00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.285
No, really,
I promise you, it's delicious.


00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:47.447
- Dead end!
- Dead end.


00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:50.126
- Mine! Mine!
- No, mine.


00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.850
- Mine.
- No, mine!


00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.610
Mine, mine.


00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:58.329
- Dead end.
- Dead end? Not a dead end for me.


00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:01.364
But it's definitely a dead end for you.


00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:05.405
I brought you guys here on purpose.
You're the ones who are trapped.


00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:09.844
Altera's best warriors are almost here
and that makes this the end for you.


00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:15.285
Come on out, soldiers!
Number One, Number Two, attack!


00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:27.482
Faster, faster! I hope they believe me.


00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:33.931
Get out fast.
Beasts are in our forest. Go south!


00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.128
Beasts are coming?


00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:45.250
Arrows. Fire.


00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:02.161
Tasty. Oh, boy.


00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.970
One, Two, come on!


00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:11.811
Human.


00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:17.765
Hey, I'm pretty skinny. The bigger,
fatter humans went that way.


00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:20.804
- I'll show you where they are.
- Liar! Good enough.


00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.325
Yeah! On the spit.


00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:27.365
- You sure you want to do this?
- Make him scream!


00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:32.930
- On the fire.
- I hate unfair fights!


00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:35.202
What?


00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.650
Number One, Two, come on!


00:07:58.560 --> 00:07:59.846
Come on!


00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:14.080
Help! Help!


00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:25.966
They're OK! Great.
Hey, guys. Good you made it.


00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:31.650
Don't worry. This is weird.
I'll figure this out.


00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:33.603
Oh, no.


00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:51.601
Where? What the...


00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.242
- I caught a fish.
- Fish?


00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:58.688
- Grab the sword, fish!
- Who are you?


00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:04.010
You look like a fighter.


00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:06.521
Let's see what you can do
with a wooden sword.


00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:09.610
Those beasts were going
to have you for lunch.


00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:12.405
But I saved your butt. You owe me.


00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:15.967
I could throw you back,
but this is going to be fun!


00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:22.123
Your defense is weak.
It's full of holes.


00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:26.564
With a real sword,
you'd be dead already. Come on!


00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:31.049
Lose your balance, you lose your life.
Think you're hiding?


00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:35.929
Sloppy, weak, late.


00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:41.649
A wager. You hit me just once,
I buy you a real sword.


00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:47.760
That's not fighting, that's tickling.


00:09:57.480 --> 00:10:00.529
You can't hide from your fate, fish.


00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.167
See?


00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:15.770
Smoked fish. Smells pretty good.


00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.963
Dead? I killed him already?


00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:21.521
That's cheating!


00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:27.726
- Not bad.
- I would say I won.


00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:30.002
- But are you sure?
- Huh?


00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:39.890
What to do with you now?
Stop this!


00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:43.322
Varnak, are you done
with your little game?


00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:48.326
Varnak?
The famous mercenary? Varnak?


00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:49.606
That's me.


00:10:49.720 --> 00:10:53.850
- Wow! I just beat Varnak!
- Beat me?


00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:57.885
I was just having some fun, Gerrant.


00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.844
And you're Gerrant,
the famous dragon fighter.


00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:06.210
Brother, look what else came
flying aboard. Let's keep them.


00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:09.927
Argenta has a weakness
for small creatures.


00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:14.204
Creatures? Those are great soldiers.
We're unbeatable.


00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:16.931
They're my best friends
and if you team up with us,


00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:19.725
we'll send those beasts
back to the dark mountains.


00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:25.210
- We can't return now.
- OK. I have no choice. It's your ship.


00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:29.370
Alright, guys, no matter what,
we are a team. This is fun, guys, huh?


00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:33.411
And Varnak, you owe me that sword.
A really good sword. A big sword.


00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:36.962
- A great sword!
- Fish, you barely touched me.


00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:40.084
- Varnak, we all saw it.
- Whose side are you on?


00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:44.000
- I was just kidding around.
- A really great sword!


00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:52.565
Alliance? We're enemies.
And have been for years.


00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:54.444
Altera will not survive, your highness.


00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.927
Princess, this is the human palace.


00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:01.364
Priest! Why don't you
save that for the beast, Terram?


00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:06.963
If it weren't for Nerwin's reputation,
I wouldn't be here either.


00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:10.920
That's enough from you, witch.
You have no official standing here.


00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:14.971
- Is that clear?
- Stop! Let her speak.


00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:17.651
Not that I believe any elf words,
anyway.


00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:22.721
Your highness, you may not trust the
elves, but the elfin map does not lie.


00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:25.724
The Black Dragon's forces
are moving across the land.


00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:28.923
You humans know that
if the dragon wakes from hibernation,


00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:30.969
it will be stronger than ever.


00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:33.481
This may be the last chance for Altera.


00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:37.368
- I beg you, your highness.
- Princess!


00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:40.768
Now is the time to forget the past
and form an alliance.


00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:42.609
We must kill the Black Dragon.


00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:45.007
Nerwin is right.
There's no time to waste.


00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.208
- We must act.
- Kasarana, you're out of line.


00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:50.722
Altera is in danger.
We are all in danger.


00:12:55.720 --> 00:13:00.487
It's true, the elves and the sorceresses
cannot be trusted.


00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:04.725
But we priests sense this evil, too.
Perhaps it is time for an alliance.


00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:09.728
Dragons and beasts. Beasts and dragons.


00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:13.003
They were defeated by us decades ago.


00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:17.011
Now you want me to go to war,
just because of some map?


00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:19.521
What kind of joke is this?


00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:26.684
Iron soft as butter when heated.
Just like a human heart.


00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:28.928
Just like the heart of a warrior.


00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:32.044
Tough when cold. Soft when hot.


00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:36.927
A big shield for ten gold pieces,
the best sword for ten gold pieces.


00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:40.567
Old man, I need to buy this boy a sword.
The cheaper, the better.


00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:45.481
Hang on, that wasn't the deal.
I want the best sword.


00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:52.323
Never seen you buy a sword
for anyone, Varnak.


00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:55.484
Why, you! This kid is unusual.


00:13:55.680 --> 00:14:00.925
I've seen him take on a dozen beasts
with just a dagger.


00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.805
He can even stand up to a dragon,
I'll bet.


00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:06.281
And with his skill,


00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:10.405
he only needs a sword
that costs five gold pieces.


00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:11.851
Mm-hmm. Huh?


00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:14.566
What have you got for five gold pieces?


00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:18.691
I only make the best.
But I can make one for you for seven.


00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:25.684
- How about just a little cheaper?
- Seven gold... and three for the hilt.


00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:30.321
What?! That's ten.
Do you think I'm stupid?


00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:32.090
Forget it, I'm not even going to buy it.


00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:34.202
You have no choice!
You have to buy it. I beat you!


00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:39.121
Famous Varnak, beaten by a young boy
and now trying to cheat him?


00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:43.211
He cheated. He's a trickster.
Little fish.


00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:53.283
Watch out!


00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:57.887
An elf?


00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:01.404
My word, that's an elf!


00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:08.124
- She owes me an apology!
- Forget it. No one can catch an elf.


00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.607
Let's get her!


00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:14.043
An elf in Saint's Haven.
That is so strange.


00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:17.562
Yes, and she just paid me cash
for a dozen arrowheads.


00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:20.365
Best work I've ever done. Full price!


00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:25.325
We'll catch her.


00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:30.084
You go this way!


00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:48.523
First I beat Varnak,
now I'm going to catch an elf.


00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:51.723
Number One, Number Two,
get her!


00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:06.164
That thief stole my pot!
Come back here!


00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:10.888
Fast! Get out of here! She's vicious!
That was crazy.


00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:17.608
- What is this for?
- Looks like it fits you.


00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:20.610
Save it, you might need it.


00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:45.761
Yeah. Try one of your elf tricks now!
How are you going to get out of this?


00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:48.131
Don't kick. Don't. Don't.


00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:59.443
Not sure catching you was worth it.


00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:01.369
You didn't catch me! We fell.


00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:04.245
I'm the fastest human you've ever seen.


00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:06.362
You're completely hopeless.


00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.930
This is not looking good.


00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:14.761
- Oh, no. Bombs.
- Bombs?


00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:17.207
Tasty dessert.


00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:23.250
Hi, guys. I caught an elf.
Impressive, huh? Right over there.


00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:25.283
What are you doing? You traitor!


00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:30.531
- Elf.
- Sweet.


00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:46.802
- He's yours.
- Huh?


00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:54.203
He was mine. Come on.


00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:05.166
- Haven't seen an elf arrow before, huh?
- Careful.


00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:07.521
You'd better leave those to me.


00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:11.406
Hey, how do you do that?
You elves have so many secrets.


00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:14.808
You're a human.
I'm definitely not telling you.


00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:19.523
Oh, no. Looks like you're going
to have to trust a human now.


00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.765
I'll take this side.


00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:27.164
You got any training with a sword?


00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:32.326
Because I think I can handle
all this by myself.


00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:36.843
- Elves are so full of themselves.
- Let go of my hand, please.


00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:38.570
OK. Can elves fly?


00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.962
Touch me again and you will regret it.


00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:50.007
- Oops. You just touched me.
- I think you just touched me again.


00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:53.249
You take the slow ones.
Leave the rest for me.


00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:04.890
- Who's that?
- Hey, Gerrant!


00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:17.126
Argenta, watch out! Huh?


00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:18.611
Whoa.


00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:23.443
The Black Dragon's coming!


00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:25.880
No!


00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:33.090
Blood, meat!


00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:37.041
Kill them all.


00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:38.969
- Watch this.
- No! Stop.


00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:57.566
Take this!


00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:06.526
Uh-oh.


00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.927
- No need. Wait.
- What?


00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:22.129
- Kuke, round them up!
- Yes, sir. Right now. Get them all!


00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:29.923
That beast was huge. I am incredible.


00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:33.567
You didn't do that.
It was the guy on the horse.


00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:43.009
- Gerrant, it is good to see you.
- Velskud, I have missed our friendship.


00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:48.411
These times are hard on all friendships.


00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.648
I'm glad you're here.
I need someone I can trust.


00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:53.491
And I see the king has promoted you.
I'm impressed.


00:20:57.160 --> 00:21:00.687
Don't be. The king has always been
more impressed with you.


00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:04.762
I don't think he's going to be impressed
after this happened in Saint's Haven.


00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:08.851
We'll tell him together,
and we can both endure his wrath.


00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:14.486
No! Velskud! Is that a beast helmet?


00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:19.840
Yes, it was an unexpected beast attack
and we repelled it.


00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.371
No! Impossible!


00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:24.290
I fear it means
the Black Dragon is reviving.


00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:27.529
No, no, it can't be.


00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:32.129
Why when I am king?
Things were going so well.


00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:34.521
- We cannot ignore this any more.
- But...


00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:38.565
Your highness, now you see,
the map at all times reflects the truth.


00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:45.363
As your advisor, I reluctantly
admit that Nerwin was right.


00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:48.370
War means gold,
and me and my ship are ready.


00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:52.564
- Your highness, Gerrant.
- Argenta.


00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:53.806
At your service.


00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:59.404
The time has come. Altera must unite.
You must decide.


00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:06.284
Yes, an alliance,
but only under my banner.


00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:10.200
Elves, if you agree,
summon your troops.


00:22:32.520 --> 00:22:38.129
Number Two! Where did you go?
Number One, Number Two!


00:22:40.680 --> 00:22:43.604
Number One! Number Two!


00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:50.920
Ow!


00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:10.846
Wow.


00:23:13.520 --> 00:23:16.763
I hope we can celebrate
at the end of this, too.


00:23:18.680 --> 00:23:22.241
- Have you seen my dogs?
- Dogs?


00:23:22.360 --> 00:23:26.445
Fish, you've got to prepare for battle.
Pack your things. We're off to war.


00:23:26.560 --> 00:23:27.686
You'll be swimming in gold.


00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:31.890
Don't laugh. Where are my dogs?


00:23:33.120 --> 00:23:37.284
Ah, Fish,
now is the time for you to learn.


00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:41.889
Life is unpredictable and really brutal.


00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:56.442
There you are! Number One! Number Two!
I found you! I'm so happy to see you!


00:23:56.560 --> 00:23:58.164
Hey!


00:24:01.440 --> 00:24:02.965
What is this?


00:24:03.080 --> 00:24:05.890
Er... yeah, yeah.


00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:08.367
The old man thinks they're really cute.


00:24:08.480 --> 00:24:13.247
What? No, you traded them for the sword
for the kid. And that's the truth.


00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:16.767
You what?


00:24:17.880 --> 00:24:21.601
Fish, you would be wise to stay here
and train with me, too.


00:24:21.720 --> 00:24:24.530
- Blacksmithing is a good skill to know.
- Blacksmith?


00:24:24.640 --> 00:24:26.688
Don't listen to anything he says.
Nothing he says.


00:24:26.800 --> 00:24:29.770
My advice is that the boy and the dogs
stay here with me.


00:24:29.880 --> 00:24:34.169
It is safer here and he won't be
of any good to you where you're going.


00:24:34.320 --> 00:24:38.086
Stay here?
I'm training him to be a warrior.


00:24:38.200 --> 00:24:39.247
Think about it, Varnak.


00:24:39.400 --> 00:24:42.563
He is small and will be
the first target of the beasts.


00:24:42.680 --> 00:24:46.730
They will show him no mercy
and these dogs will never see him again.


00:24:46.880 --> 00:24:49.884
Varnak saved my life.
I must be loyal to him.


00:24:50.000 --> 00:24:55.928
Guys, this is goodbye.
It's too dangerous out there for you.


00:24:57.120 --> 00:25:03.002
I'll earn a lot of gold and I will
buy both of you back. I promise.


00:25:04.240 --> 00:25:08.370
Blacksmith, these are my best friends
and now they're in your care.


00:25:08.480 --> 00:25:12.929
You've got to make me your very best
sword, no matter the cost.


00:25:14.080 --> 00:25:18.210
Number One, Number Two, be good.
Make me proud. No tears.


00:25:18.360 --> 00:25:21.250
Ignore the kid.
The price doesn't change. Got it?


00:25:22.600 --> 00:25:24.045
Boy's got a big heart.


00:25:24.160 --> 00:25:28.529
He will make a lousy warrior
because he will always just follow it.


00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:33.163
Mind your own business!
Stick to making swords.


00:25:37.280 --> 00:25:41.080
Cute dogs. They yours?
They seem to like you.


00:25:42.040 --> 00:25:45.567
I got something in my eyes.
What's that over there?


00:25:47.040 --> 00:25:51.489
A warrior, crying over dogs?
That's quite charming.


00:25:52.520 --> 00:25:58.687
- You just leave me alone, OK?
- Alright, I'll leave you alone.


00:26:11.760 --> 00:26:14.445
Hey! What did you shoot at?


00:26:20.160 --> 00:26:22.242
Whoa! Whoa!


00:26:25.400 --> 00:26:30.042
- Whoa! Careful. Don't shoot me.
- There was someone up here.


00:26:31.360 --> 00:26:34.364
There was a statue.


00:26:37.280 --> 00:26:42.889
- Relax. I won't tell anyone.
- I know I saw something moving.


00:26:44.080 --> 00:26:48.449
Hey. Come here. Look.
Now, that's a dinner we should be at.


00:26:48.560 --> 00:26:51.803
Yes, well,
last time I heard from you people,


00:26:51.960 --> 00:26:56.363
the Black Dragon was locked
in the mountains for 100 years.


00:26:56.560 --> 00:26:58.085
Who can I trust here?


00:26:58.200 --> 00:27:03.081
If the beasts are attacking,
that means the dragon could wake soon.


00:27:03.200 --> 00:27:05.646
The danger is great.


00:27:08.120 --> 00:27:11.681
Nothing to be scared of.
I say fly there and kill it!


00:27:11.800 --> 00:27:14.041
Its resting place is heavily defended.


00:27:14.160 --> 00:27:17.846
And it's also protected
by a treacherous mountain range.


00:27:17.960 --> 00:27:21.726
Are you saying
you can't beat those beasts?


00:27:21.840 --> 00:27:23.968
Their forces are much larger than ours.


00:27:24.120 --> 00:27:27.044
We can't face the beasts
and the Black Dragon at the same time.


00:27:27.160 --> 00:27:30.642
After all these years of hibernation,
the dragon will be a fearsome foe.


00:27:30.760 --> 00:27:33.570
And if we get to it before it wakes?


00:27:33.680 --> 00:27:36.684
I fear any close approach
will awaken it.


00:27:36.840 --> 00:27:39.764
So, you mean to say...
Well, in that case, we're all dead!


00:27:40.800 --> 00:27:42.768
The dragon does have a weakness.


00:27:42.880 --> 00:27:46.123
Its awesome power
comes from a gem in its chest.


00:27:46.240 --> 00:27:50.404
Remove the gem,
and the dragon is vulnerable.


00:27:50.600 --> 00:27:55.128
- Yes, that's right.
- A gem. I wonder what that's worth.


00:27:55.240 --> 00:27:58.449
Legend has it the gem has great powers.


00:27:58.600 --> 00:28:01.683
It can kill and it can revive the dead.


00:28:01.800 --> 00:28:06.522
Your highness, this gem should belong
to the humans here in Saint's Haven.


00:28:06.640 --> 00:28:09.769
Terram!
This must be a mission for peace!


00:28:09.880 --> 00:28:14.363
The war is under the king's banner,
so the spoils belong to us.


00:28:14.520 --> 00:28:16.921
There's no room for black magic
from you sorceresses!


00:28:17.040 --> 00:28:20.886
Typical! First you tell the king
there's no threat,


00:28:21.040 --> 00:28:22.804
then you want all the power
for yourself.


00:28:22.920 --> 00:28:25.810
If the alliance fights,
then this is up to the king!


00:28:25.920 --> 00:28:28.810
Yes, and it's your troops
that let the beasts invade the city.


00:28:28.920 --> 00:28:31.241
Why is it
that you make all the decisions?


00:28:31.400 --> 00:28:35.325
Why should anyone trust you
with anything?! Soldier.


00:28:35.480 --> 00:28:38.768
- Kasarana, that's enough!
- Do you always fight like this?


00:28:38.880 --> 00:28:41.121
If elves join this battle,
we should have a say as well.


00:28:41.280 --> 00:28:43.009
As long as
it's not the priests.


00:28:43.120 --> 00:28:48.126
I'll settle this. Get the gem
and sell it, then split the gold.


00:28:48.240 --> 00:28:51.767
Hey, hey, hey! Listen to yourselves!


00:28:51.880 --> 00:28:53.962
How can you fight like this?


00:28:54.080 --> 00:28:56.242
Take a break and listen to my idea.


00:28:56.360 --> 00:29:00.001
First, Kuke.
Kuke's army attacks from the front


00:29:00.120 --> 00:29:01.963
and draws the attention
of the beast army.


00:29:02.080 --> 00:29:04.606
- You little village rat!
- Hang on! Hang on.


00:29:04.760 --> 00:29:07.331
Meanwhile, our small group
flies on Varnak's ship.


00:29:07.440 --> 00:29:08.487
Yeah!


00:29:08.680 --> 00:29:10.728
All the way to the rear
of the dragon's nest,


00:29:10.840 --> 00:29:12.808
and we both attack at the same time!


00:29:15.080 --> 00:29:16.969
We sneak in,
catch the dragon before it wakes,


00:29:17.080 --> 00:29:21.688
make a fast attack,
grab the gem and fly back.


00:29:21.800 --> 00:29:23.290
Perfect. And guess what?


00:29:23.400 --> 00:29:27.485
I've already got one elf signed on.
We're ready to go.


00:29:31.600 --> 00:29:32.840
Stay Out! " No!"


00:29:34.360 --> 00:29:36.169
Let's listen.


00:29:36.280 --> 00:29:40.729
- Who is this kid?
- Actually, I like his plan.


00:29:40.880 --> 00:29:44.441
Velskud, what do you think?


00:29:46.040 --> 00:29:49.522
Gerrant, you know dragons the best.


00:29:49.760 --> 00:29:52.366
Even if we kill the Black Dragon
and capture the gem,


00:29:52.480 --> 00:29:55.404
this gem can corrupt the most innocent.


00:29:55.560 --> 00:30:00.521
One thing I'm sure of,
the Black Dragon gem must be destroyed.


00:30:05.040 --> 00:30:07.725
I don't think humans and elves
can work together very well.


00:30:07.840 --> 00:30:09.649
And priests and witches.


00:30:10.680 --> 00:30:13.524
But you made a big impression on them.
You should be proud.


00:30:13.720 --> 00:30:17.088
Now you see the truth.
I'm the best.


00:30:17.200 --> 00:30:19.407
I'm going to be a great warrior.


00:30:19.520 --> 00:30:22.444
Human boys.
I should have known better.


00:30:22.560 --> 00:30:24.210
This is not bad. Tasty.


00:30:38.120 --> 00:30:41.841
Velskud, my love,
can you feel it?


00:30:41.960 --> 00:30:45.806
The plan is unfolding
just as I told you it would.


00:30:47.160 --> 00:30:52.291
You are so close to what you
always wanted. It is at hand.


00:30:52.400 --> 00:30:58.567
You will be the most powerful king
Altera has ever had.


00:30:58.760 --> 00:31:02.810
Velskud! I've got new orders for you.


00:31:02.960 --> 00:31:06.601
The Black Dragon gem should be mine.


00:31:06.840 --> 00:31:08.968
Kill the dragon
and bring the gem to me.


00:31:09.080 --> 00:31:13.290
Whoever controls the black gem
will control all of Altera.


00:31:13.400 --> 00:31:16.847
And that is why
the Black Dragon gem must be mine,


00:31:16.960 --> 00:31:18.291
and you must get it for me.


00:31:18.400 --> 00:31:24.806
And I will be all-powerful.
And you will be my general.


00:31:24.920 --> 00:31:29.801
General? Our future king has
no interest in being a general.


00:31:29.920 --> 00:31:34.881
Who is that? A dark elf!
Velskud, kill her! She can't be here!


00:31:35.080 --> 00:31:38.721
- Kill her!
- Kill? I like the sound of that.


00:31:41.960 --> 00:31:46.921
Not the... the dark elf. It's...


00:31:48.920 --> 00:31:53.528
King Velskud.
It fits so well, doesn't it?


00:31:54.600 --> 00:31:59.891
The Black Dragon will wake soon. It's
time for you to leave on your mission.


00:32:11.920 --> 00:32:14.321
Wow. It's a beauty.


00:32:29.440 --> 00:32:31.522
Hey, what's so funny?


00:32:31.640 --> 00:32:36.282
You. But I think it's cute.
I like you in armor.


00:32:42.480 --> 00:32:46.166
- We will be gone before anyone knows.
- We can never be sure of that.


00:32:46.280 --> 00:32:49.807
I can get new sails out of this,
maybe even a new anchor.


00:33:13.400 --> 00:33:17.530
What's your problem, fish?
You still whining about those dogs?


00:33:17.680 --> 00:33:23.847
I let them down. But I'll return and
trade in this sword to get them back.


00:33:23.960 --> 00:33:25.121
That's what I'm going to do.


00:33:29.160 --> 00:33:33.370
Well, I bought back the dogs and paid
the blacksmith to take care of them.


00:33:34.640 --> 00:33:36.688
And you better practice with that sword,


00:33:36.840 --> 00:33:38.763
or you might not make it back
from the mission.


00:33:38.920 --> 00:33:41.730
- You'll be beast food.
- Thank you, Varnak.


00:33:41.880 --> 00:33:43.484
You have a real heart under that armor.


00:33:43.600 --> 00:33:45.443
I wouldn't go that far.


00:33:49.360 --> 00:33:52.967
No! No!


00:33:54.280 --> 00:33:55.770
Hang on!


00:33:58.720 --> 00:34:01.326
Get a hold! I've got it under control.


00:34:04.400 --> 00:34:05.481
What?!


00:34:16.160 --> 00:34:17.730
Liya!


00:34:28.280 --> 00:34:34.128
My ship. I didn't get paid for this.
This never happens to me!


00:34:38.400 --> 00:34:40.084
This won't stop us.


00:34:40.200 --> 00:34:43.044
Nerwin, can you find us
a way there in time?


00:34:43.160 --> 00:34:44.844
It's possible. We can make it.


00:34:45.000 --> 00:34:48.243
The terrain is bad,
but the map will guide us.


00:34:48.360 --> 00:34:52.922
Bad luck. I call it bad luck.


00:34:58.720 --> 00:35:01.644
- Get off me!
- No. My ship!


00:35:01.760 --> 00:35:03.967
Now we won't make it.
Kuke will beat us there.


00:35:04.120 --> 00:35:06.930
He will wake the Black Dragon
if he arrives first.


00:35:07.080 --> 00:35:09.560
We have no alternative.
We can't turn back.


00:35:09.720 --> 00:35:12.041
- Wait, wait.
- Here you are.


00:35:12.160 --> 00:35:15.004
- Summon an elf flying ship?
- Impossible.


00:35:15.120 --> 00:35:19.011
- Quit arguing! There's dragons to kill.
- We'll need a shorter route.


00:35:19.160 --> 00:35:22.084
Then we'll be closer to beast
territory. So which way is it?


00:35:22.200 --> 00:35:24.521
Should have brought an elf ship.


00:35:25.760 --> 00:35:30.209
Elf ship? This was
the best ship in Altera. Was.


00:35:44.600 --> 00:35:45.840
Step aside.


00:35:46.000 --> 00:35:50.688
<i>My heart beats like a weapon.</i>


00:35:52.000 --> 00:35:54.731
<i>Fighting for your love.</i>


00:35:56.840 --> 00:35:58.649
<i>I'm a soldier.</i>


00:36:00.760 --> 00:36:02.364
<i>For your love.</i>


00:36:04.560 --> 00:36:06.369
<i>I'm a soldier.</i>


00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:14.087
<i>For your love.</i>


00:36:18.280 --> 00:36:23.764
<i>My heart beats like a weapon.</i>


00:36:23.880 --> 00:36:28.408
<i>I'm a soldier for your love</i>


00:36:30.560 --> 00:36:32.403
I charge double for walking.


00:36:42.560 --> 00:36:46.201
Liya, do you know where we are now?
Because“.


00:36:46.320 --> 00:36:48.687
Here.
We're about halfway to the dragon nest.


00:36:48.840 --> 00:36:50.080
Halfway.


00:36:51.680 --> 00:36:55.082
I got blisters
the size of an elf's foot already.


00:37:00.680 --> 00:37:03.160
I'm the smallest one,
but I'm carrying everything.


00:37:03.320 --> 00:37:06.608
Shh!
Young, dumb and noisy. Quiet.


00:37:06.720 --> 00:37:12.250
- Sorry. Sorry. What is this?
- These are the Ruins Forgotten By Time.


00:37:14.160 --> 00:37:17.881
A battle in the war between the elves
and humans was fought here.


00:37:18.080 --> 00:37:21.243
Many elves were slaughtered.


00:37:21.360 --> 00:37:26.207
The elf ghosts still inhabit this place
and no one should enter.


00:37:26.360 --> 00:37:31.685
Ghosts? I hate ghosts.
Did you say ghosts?


00:37:31.800 --> 00:37:34.201
No!


00:37:37.480 --> 00:37:40.689
- No!
- Another delay.


00:37:43.160 --> 00:37:48.405
Future king,
I am watching over you. I love you.


00:37:48.520 --> 00:37:50.921
Time is running out.
You must make them hurry.


00:37:53.040 --> 00:37:56.362
My feet are killing me
and you made me come down here.


00:37:58.360 --> 00:38:00.249
Fish, you are a disaster.


00:38:00.360 --> 00:38:03.011
I wouldn't have fallen if you didn't
load me up with everything.


00:38:03.160 --> 00:38:06.369
Stop making excuses and just move.


00:38:20.880 --> 00:38:23.963
Liya, don't touch them. Be careful.


00:38:24.120 --> 00:38:27.283
They are our kin.
They are crying out to us.


00:38:27.400 --> 00:38:31.564
They're lost. The treachery
of humans created this war.


00:38:32.440 --> 00:38:35.489
They're waiting to be freed,
but it will take some strong magic.


00:38:38.720 --> 00:38:42.327
This tragedy was not
only the fault of the humans.


00:38:42.480 --> 00:38:45.927
- Yes, it was.
- Ignore these creatures.


00:38:46.040 --> 00:38:50.409
Don't let them distract us.
The Black Dragon is our goal.


00:38:51.680 --> 00:38:55.321
They're just vapor.
I can't even swing a sword at these.


00:38:57.520 --> 00:39:00.490
Lambert's fall forced us
to take the shortest route.


00:39:00.600 --> 00:39:03.444
I don't need a map
to find the shortest way.


00:39:03.560 --> 00:39:05.961
- You are a clumsy warrior.
- I like you calling me a...


00:39:06.080 --> 00:39:08.560
Circle up!


00:39:08.680 --> 00:39:11.286
Strangers. Intruders.


00:39:13.840 --> 00:39:15.251
I'm ready.


00:39:19.320 --> 00:39:22.608
What is this I see?
Humans and elves together?


00:39:22.720 --> 00:39:25.451
It's the bat
of the dark mountains.


00:39:25.560 --> 00:39:26.800
What?


00:39:26.920 --> 00:39:30.129
Pretty far from home.
Bats scout for beasts.


00:39:30.280 --> 00:39:31.930
Then we can't let him out of here,
right?


00:39:33.840 --> 00:39:36.286
Only one, should be easy to kill.


00:39:37.880 --> 00:39:43.125
Yes, indeed. Humans and elves,
a priest, a sorceress who controls fire


00:39:43.280 --> 00:39:45.806
and some other strange beings, too?


00:39:45.920 --> 00:39:46.967
You're a talker.


00:39:47.120 --> 00:39:52.809
Something important must be happening.
Humans and elves in this territory.


00:39:53.840 --> 00:39:59.131
- Bat. What do you want?
- Me? I want nothing, or little.


00:39:59.280 --> 00:40:02.329
I am very peaceful and friendly.


00:40:02.440 --> 00:40:05.444
But that's me.
I protect the dragon territory.


00:40:05.560 --> 00:40:09.770
And the beasts will be very interested
to know about this.


00:40:09.880 --> 00:40:12.406
Yes, indeed, they will want
to offer you their own welcome.


00:40:12.520 --> 00:40:16.241
They will be very interested to know
that humans and elves are together.


00:40:16.400 --> 00:40:20.166
But to keep a secret,
that will cost you.


00:40:20.320 --> 00:40:23.369
We crashed here. You can
tell your friends we're going home.


00:40:23.520 --> 00:40:27.764
Beast territory. For you, expensive.
For me, rewarding.


00:40:27.880 --> 00:40:29.769
- You'll die!
- Velskud, stop!


00:40:30.800 --> 00:40:32.609
Fun!


00:40:39.680 --> 00:40:41.967
Spread out!


00:40:57.840 --> 00:40:59.842
Not bad, but I'll finish them off.


00:41:10.440 --> 00:41:12.010
Take that.


00:41:13.800 --> 00:41:16.565
Here I come. Try and get me.


00:41:18.520 --> 00:41:19.601
Liya, don't shoot!


00:41:25.160 --> 00:41:28.482
Good shot!
See if you can force him toward me.


00:42:21.280 --> 00:42:24.011
Impossible. You'll never catch me.


00:42:27.960 --> 00:42:29.849
No. No!


00:42:31.760 --> 00:42:35.481
Got you, blabber mouth!
No giving up our position now.


00:42:35.560 --> 00:42:39.610
Looks like my fish is a flying one.


00:42:52.120 --> 00:42:56.409
He talked too much.
Liya, you were amazing.


00:42:56.520 --> 00:43:01.731
We make a great team. The best.
Without us, this mission would be over!


00:43:01.840 --> 00:43:04.684
Stow it, fish! You're the one
who got us here in the first place.


00:43:05.720 --> 00:43:08.405
I've got to admit, you're right.
But we stopped the bat.


00:43:08.560 --> 00:43:11.040
And besides,
the map says I found the shortest way.


00:43:11.160 --> 00:43:13.925
- Let's go!
- You, navigating?


00:43:15.800 --> 00:43:18.280
As long as you're not using
that sword, you're not bad.


00:43:18.440 --> 00:43:21.569
You've really got to teach me
that bow and arrow thing.


00:43:21.680 --> 00:43:24.524
That bat would have
revealed our mission.


00:43:24.640 --> 00:43:27.769
It said it saw strange beings.
What did it mean?


00:43:27.880 --> 00:43:30.360
That was just meaningless chatter,
nothing more.


00:43:30.520 --> 00:43:33.524
So, which one of you guys
is the strange creature?


00:43:33.640 --> 00:43:36.849
Because you both look
a little strange to me.


00:43:41.480 --> 00:43:44.086
We elves, we were wronged here.


00:43:44.200 --> 00:43:47.682
I will be back to free you
when I have that gem.


00:44:00.160 --> 00:44:05.246
I give up. This bow and arrow
is not my thing. I just can't do it.


00:44:05.360 --> 00:44:06.930
May I?


00:44:12.480 --> 00:44:15.689
Maybe it's this armor. It's a bit tight.


00:44:23.960 --> 00:44:25.883
Whoa.


00:44:32.080 --> 00:44:34.765
The most important thing
is not power or strength,


00:44:34.920 --> 00:44:37.002
but the heart and desire.


00:44:38.920 --> 00:44:42.447
Use your focus and intention
to get what you want.


00:44:42.600 --> 00:44:45.968
That's what we elves learn
and use in everything we do.


00:44:46.120 --> 00:44:49.044
You need to learn that.


00:44:49.160 --> 00:44:54.724
I understand power,
and I have been told I have a big heart.


00:44:54.840 --> 00:44:58.083
Humans are not to be trusted.
They have always disappointed the elves


00:44:58.200 --> 00:45:00.407
and made selfish decisions
that have hurt us.


00:45:00.560 --> 00:45:06.203
The princess told me to be careful with
you. But I sense that I can trust you.


00:45:06.320 --> 00:45:09.449
- Can I?
- Of course you can trust me.


00:45:09.640 --> 00:45:12.962
I have nothing to hide. Nerwin is wrong.


00:45:13.080 --> 00:45:16.687
We can show all the elves and humans
that we can get along.


00:45:16.800 --> 00:45:19.485
I'll be there for you
whenever you need me.


00:45:19.640 --> 00:45:22.450
We can be a team like no elf
and human has ever been before.


00:45:22.600 --> 00:45:25.410
Liya, I'm not going to disappoint you.


00:45:38.720 --> 00:45:43.408
- Liya! It's time to go.
- We have to go.


00:45:59.200 --> 00:46:02.966
The closer we get to the gem,
the more I want to change.


00:46:03.080 --> 00:46:06.482
I feel a shadow of dread
touching my whole being.


00:46:06.640 --> 00:46:09.928
We can't reveal our other side.
There would be no going back.


00:46:10.040 --> 00:46:13.089
- We have no choice now.
- Of course we do.


00:46:13.200 --> 00:46:16.886
Gerrant, they won't understand.
We'll be their enemy.


00:46:17.040 --> 00:46:18.690
Then so be it.


00:46:18.800 --> 00:46:23.442
I miss my ship.
But I don't want to hear you complain.


00:46:23.600 --> 00:46:26.604
My mouth is frozen, I can't complain.


00:46:26.760 --> 00:46:30.845
This is just a wall of ice. Are you sure
it is the entrance to the dragon nest?


00:46:30.960 --> 00:46:35.010
- The elf map cannot be wrong.
- It's here somewhere, it must be.


00:46:35.120 --> 00:46:37.327
Here, let me.


00:46:38.560 --> 00:46:39.641
Frozen feet.


00:46:39.760 --> 00:46:43.446
What do you know of the power
of the gem? Why do you fear it?


00:46:44.680 --> 00:46:46.364
I know nothing more than you.


00:46:47.880 --> 00:46:50.770
I sense you know more about it
than you say. Have you ever touched one?


00:46:50.880 --> 00:46:54.566
I know once you touch a powerful gem,
it becomes forever a part of you,


00:46:54.760 --> 00:46:56.285
good and evil.


00:46:56.400 --> 00:46:58.482
- It's here, the portal.
- Stop! Brother!


00:47:00.080 --> 00:47:03.482
Step aside. This calls for fire.


00:47:11.880 --> 00:47:15.930
The battle of the three dragons.
The symbol of the dragon race.


00:47:16.040 --> 00:47:19.601
It is a powerful seal,
holding a great evil inside.


00:47:19.800 --> 00:47:22.929
If we open it, what might be released?


00:47:23.040 --> 00:47:27.284
You're saying this is a door,
so there must be a handle, right?


00:47:29.200 --> 00:47:33.250
Varnak, wait. He's right.
There must be a secret way to open it.


00:47:33.360 --> 00:47:37.251
I see it. There, under the ice,
is another dragon symbol.


00:48:07.400 --> 00:48:10.927
Wow. It's not going to get
any warmer in here.


00:48:12.240 --> 00:48:15.244
That's not good.


00:48:17.760 --> 00:48:22.004
Sentinel Dragon,
Chaos Dragon, Void Dragon.


00:48:22.120 --> 00:48:26.091
Your reign is over,
and mine is about to start.


00:48:38.320 --> 00:48:42.803
I was not expecting this.
Everything here is frozen, like my feet.


00:48:48.520 --> 00:48:50.921
This is too easy,
and we are vulnerable here.


00:48:51.040 --> 00:48:53.407
We don't have any choice.


00:48:56.640 --> 00:48:59.564
Don't make any noise and stay alert.


00:49:07.520 --> 00:49:09.204
What is that?


00:49:10.840 --> 00:49:13.127
It is a guardian of the dragon nest.
Kill it!


00:49:36.960 --> 00:49:42.410
- Follow me. We must get out of here.
- He's right. This way.


00:50:01.840 --> 00:50:03.604
Watch out!


00:50:06.440 --> 00:50:07.851
Watch out!


00:50:09.080 --> 00:50:10.286
Liya!


00:50:32.960 --> 00:50:34.371
I'm your hero, right?


00:50:40.400 --> 00:50:43.404
Don't worry, hero. I've got you.


00:50:44.640 --> 00:50:45.926
Avalanche!


00:50:48.360 --> 00:50:49.885
I must seal this cave.


00:50:56.640 --> 00:50:58.130
What are you doing?


00:51:05.880 --> 00:51:10.283
Gerrant, don't let it happen.
They'll kill us.


00:51:10.400 --> 00:51:15.201
Argenta, I can't stop it.
It's up to us now.


00:51:28.320 --> 00:51:32.211
- You fool, Gerrant is still in there!
- We can't let those creatures out!


00:51:32.320 --> 00:51:34.004
Our whole mission will be lost.


00:51:34.160 --> 00:51:36.208
- You...
- Look.


00:51:40.240 --> 00:51:43.164
- Gerrant. Gerrant!
- It's OK.


00:51:44.840 --> 00:51:47.081
Do we still have time to find
the Black Dragon?


00:51:47.200 --> 00:51:48.247
Stay away.


00:51:53.640 --> 00:51:58.328
We're too late.
Kuke and the army are here.


00:51:59.360 --> 00:52:01.681
They're going to wake the Black Dragon.


00:52:41.080 --> 00:52:43.481
Attack!


00:52:45.480 --> 00:52:47.448
Die!


00:52:51.520 --> 00:52:54.763
Formation! Charge!


00:54:05.560 --> 00:54:08.166
Hold your position! Don't retreat!


00:54:10.400 --> 00:54:11.686
Steady.


00:54:23.960 --> 00:54:27.601
Brother, promise me we won't die here.


00:54:32.600 --> 00:54:34.921
Brother!


00:54:35.120 --> 00:54:39.569
- We failed. The whole plan is gone!
- Now what?


00:54:39.680 --> 00:54:41.967
I just want to get out of here alive.


00:55:02.400 --> 00:55:07.930
Fish, I told you before,
life is unpredictable and brutal.


00:55:08.040 --> 00:55:11.169
- And...
- This is how it ends?


00:55:11.280 --> 00:55:17.367
I'm sorry I got you into this one.
But for us, the worst is over.


00:55:17.480 --> 00:55:21.280
We're marching back to Saint's Haven
and building us a new ship.


00:55:21.440 --> 00:55:26.207
We'll fight again, I promise.
And I can get a refill on this and...


00:55:26.320 --> 00:55:28.800
Huh?


00:55:31.360 --> 00:55:33.488
Here they come.


00:55:42.320 --> 00:55:44.209
They're coming for us!


00:56:02.760 --> 00:56:04.444
I'll get this.


00:56:08.280 --> 00:56:10.806
Fall back.
Everybody fall back, fall back.


00:56:33.520 --> 00:56:35.045
There's too many of them.


00:56:42.720 --> 00:56:46.167
That won't hold for long.
Where's my fish?


00:56:46.320 --> 00:56:48.243
- Liya and Lambert are out there.
- What now?


00:56:48.360 --> 00:56:49.486
What do we do?


00:56:50.440 --> 00:56:53.489
We must help them.
Quick. We can't stay here.


00:56:53.600 --> 00:56:57.491
Where's my fish?
He can't handle this alone.


00:57:05.480 --> 00:57:06.925
Come on.


00:57:23.760 --> 00:57:25.842
Liya. Liya!


00:57:37.800 --> 00:57:40.406
- Liya!
- Lambert.


00:57:40.560 --> 00:57:42.050
Liya.


00:57:46.920 --> 00:57:48.809
- Liya!
- Lambert!


00:58:15.960 --> 00:58:17.928
Got you.


00:59:44.760 --> 00:59:46.000
Liya, no!


00:59:50.240 --> 00:59:51.526
Liya.


00:59:52.920 --> 00:59:54.922
Liya, I'm here.


00:59:59.840 --> 01:00:01.126
Oh, God.


01:00:13.000 --> 01:00:13.500
No!


01:00:20.760 --> 01:00:22.444
Over here!


01:00:22.560 --> 01:00:24.801
- Liya!
- Lambert!


01:00:26.000 --> 01:00:27.729
Lambert!


01:00:38.920 --> 01:00:41.685
Lambert!


01:01:30.360 --> 01:01:32.010
Come on.


01:01:37.880 --> 01:01:39.644
Lambert!


01:01:41.600 --> 01:01:42.965
Brother, no!


01:01:58.240 --> 01:01:59.287
Gerrant.


01:02:31.040 --> 01:02:34.647
No, no, no. Stop.
Don't attack. It's Gerrant.


01:02:38.960 --> 01:02:41.440
Gerrant? That's a dragon.


01:02:55.800 --> 01:03:00.488
- I couldn't tell you the truth.
- You're a dragon.


01:03:01.960 --> 01:03:05.521
You're right. But I'm also human.


01:03:05.680 --> 01:03:10.083
I can control my dragon side
to do good for humans.


01:03:11.240 --> 01:03:14.449
You're a good dragon? Yeah, right.


01:03:16.480 --> 01:03:21.486
But we are dragons. And without us,
you're all going to die, for sure.


01:03:21.640 --> 01:03:23.244
We're your only hope.


01:03:23.400 --> 01:03:26.370
Dragons can never be good,
or the hope of humans.


01:03:26.480 --> 01:03:30.007
In this world,
nothing is completely good or evil.


01:03:32.680 --> 01:03:35.047
Dragons are evil.


01:03:35.160 --> 01:03:39.848
We're something new,
something Altera has never seen before.


01:03:42.120 --> 01:03:43.485
We are the future.


01:03:45.680 --> 01:03:50.049
Never. Dragons need to be
eliminated from this world.


01:04:19.880 --> 01:04:22.360
I need a bigger sword and more gold!


01:04:46.720 --> 01:04:49.326
<i>Why'? Why'?</i>


01:04:51.080 --> 01:04:53.811
Why? Why can't I change?


01:05:06.160 --> 01:05:11.121
Brother! Brother! Gerrant! No.


01:05:50.280 --> 01:05:52.282
Huh?


01:05:55.280 --> 01:05:59.330
The gem can kill,
and it can give life.


01:06:01.360 --> 01:06:07.720
Liya, I will be back.
The Black Dragon's gem will be ours.


01:06:17.680 --> 01:06:22.049
There's no way we can kill it.
It's too big. It killed the whole army.


01:06:22.880 --> 01:06:28.171
Gerrant is up there fighting for us.
We must help him.


01:06:28.280 --> 01:06:32.330
- There's nothing we can do.
- We can't beat the Black Dragon.


01:06:32.440 --> 01:06:34.488
- Kasarana.
- We're all going to die!


01:06:34.600 --> 01:06:38.525
Kasarana. It's OK. We're not lost yet.


01:06:41.840 --> 01:06:43.330
Liya.


01:06:47.920 --> 01:06:53.006
I'll get the gem. I'll fight for you!
For Liya!


01:08:14.240 --> 01:08:16.368
Fish, I'm coming to help!


01:08:28.320 --> 01:08:31.005
Varnak! Stand up!


01:09:46.720 --> 01:09:48.848
Where's my fish?


01:09:54.200 --> 01:09:55.486
Whoa!


01:10:13.200 --> 01:10:17.888
Dragon blood, dragon spirit.
Dragon blood, dragon spirit. Dragon...


01:10:29.440 --> 01:10:30.521
Lambert!


01:10:42.320 --> 01:10:43.560
We must help.


01:10:55.320 --> 01:10:57.129
Brother!


01:11:16.960 --> 01:11:19.281
Brother!


01:11:40.800 --> 01:11:45.124
- Argenta?
- Dragons fighting dragons!


01:12:06.720 --> 01:12:08.404
My 'turn!


01:13:26.480 --> 01:13:29.290
Liya!


01:14:19.920 --> 01:14:21.729
Lambert?


01:14:24.400 --> 01:14:27.449
I must have that gem.
I must save Liya.


01:14:28.480 --> 01:14:32.849
Lambert, stay away from me.
It's not safe.


01:14:32.960 --> 01:14:36.487
You cannot touch it.
It will destroy you.


01:14:36.600 --> 01:14:38.090
I can feel its power.


01:14:38.240 --> 01:14:41.722
I need that gem for Liya,
no matter what you say.


01:14:41.840 --> 01:14:46.004
See? It is already affecting you.
I'm going to destroy it.


01:14:46.160 --> 01:14:47.924
I will, Gerrant.


01:14:48.040 --> 01:14:51.931
If either of you touch this gem,
you will never be the same again.


01:14:52.040 --> 01:14:55.647
- You will be corrupted.
- I don't care!


01:15:00.960 --> 01:15:04.248
But... I can give you my gem.


01:15:04.400 --> 01:15:09.850
If there is any life left in Liya,
it will revive her. Try.


01:15:12.040 --> 01:15:15.567
- But will it work?
- It should.


01:15:15.680 --> 01:15:19.207
But go quickly.
There needs to be a spark of life.


01:15:24.840 --> 01:15:29.050
Liya, Liya, I have it. I'll save you.


01:15:38.040 --> 01:15:42.364
Liya, I love you. Come back, Liya.


01:15:43.520 --> 01:15:46.410
How does it feel to hold
the Black Dragon gem?


01:15:46.560 --> 01:15:50.645
- Do you feel its power?
- I can feel its evil.


01:15:50.800 --> 01:15:56.091
But I can't withstand it too long.
You must help me destroy it.


01:15:56.200 --> 01:16:01.240
No, I'm not going to destroy the gem.
I'm going to destroy you, dragon!


01:16:06.720 --> 01:16:08.563
No!


01:16:11.720 --> 01:16:14.291
With this gem,
I am going to rule the world.


01:16:14.440 --> 01:16:18.081
Reign over humans, elves
and even what's left of dragons!


01:16:18.200 --> 01:16:21.761
That gem will consume you.


01:16:21.880 --> 01:16:26.249
No, I will use it to destroy all of you,
and reign supreme.


01:16:26.400 --> 01:16:29.085
The gem is controlling you. Don't...


01:16:29.200 --> 01:16:34.240
The king was going to betray all of you.


01:16:34.440 --> 01:16:36.488
He was going to use this gem
for himself.


01:16:36.600 --> 01:16:39.809
That is why I killed him, too.


01:16:39.920 --> 01:16:43.561
Drop it. It's not worth it.


01:16:43.680 --> 01:16:47.321
I could let you all live
if you give your allegiance to me.


01:16:47.480 --> 01:16:51.246
The whole world will bow to me
and honor my will.


01:16:52.280 --> 01:16:57.650
Even Elena will pay homage to the
greatest king the world has ever seen.


01:16:57.800 --> 01:17:01.088
Elena? Does Elena have
something to do with this?


01:17:01.200 --> 01:17:05.569
My reign will last forever,
but I will never trust you!


01:17:05.720 --> 01:17:07.802
- Your time is over.
- I am your friend.


01:17:07.960 --> 01:17:11.043
Listen. That gem
is taking over your body and soul.


01:17:11.160 --> 01:17:12.571
You will not survive.


01:17:12.680 --> 01:17:14.284
" No!"


01:17:17.000 --> 01:17:22.564
Velskud? Velskud, listen to your friend.


01:17:22.680 --> 01:17:25.001
We're all your friends. Drop it.


01:17:25.160 --> 01:17:29.245
Velskud, you can't control
that kind of evil power.


01:17:29.360 --> 01:17:34.810
I can. I know how. Let me have it.
It will not overpower me.


01:17:34.960 --> 01:17:37.201
I will use it for all of us.


01:17:46.360 --> 01:17:49.603
- You lie. Now you die!
- No!


01:17:49.760 --> 01:17:53.321
- No! Velskud, no!
- No!


01:18:05.560 --> 01:18:07.881
Drop it, or I'll cut it from your hand.


01:18:08.000 --> 01:18:13.530
- You are a fish and I will gut you.
- No, you won't.


01:18:20.040 --> 01:18:24.329
- Surrender now, or I will finish you.
- You are a great fighter.


01:18:24.440 --> 01:18:28.923
And you can have a long life
under my rule and command.


01:18:29.040 --> 01:18:31.850
I would let you live
and be with your precious Liya.


01:18:31.960 --> 01:18:37.205
But now it is your choice.
Live or die?


01:18:45.800 --> 01:18:49.361
Join your friends. Die!


01:19:17.800 --> 01:19:22.362
I will destroy you all.
I will be all powerful.


01:19:22.520 --> 01:19:25.683
- Velskud, you can't!
- I will rule over all!


01:19:35.160 --> 01:19:37.766
Finish him before he fully transforms.


01:19:39.680 --> 01:19:42.923
You can do it, Lambert. We need you.


01:20:09.760 --> 01:20:12.047
I'll help you, Lambert.


01:20:21.720 --> 01:20:24.041
You are dead.


01:20:24.160 --> 01:20:27.846
I will absorb your life, your soul.
You will be nothing.


01:20:27.960 --> 01:20:31.169
No one will remember you were alive.


01:21:03.360 --> 01:21:08.366
Gerrant, you were right
about the power of this gem.


01:21:10.840 --> 01:21:13.889
- I know it now.
- Velskud!


01:21:33.040 --> 01:21:37.250
You were about to be food
for that beast.


01:21:37.360 --> 01:21:38.850
Liya? Liya!


01:21:59.280 --> 01:22:00.361
I'm impressed.


01:22:00.480 --> 01:22:03.290
Without your bow and arrow,
I wouldn't have made it.


01:22:03.400 --> 01:22:05.164
Oh, Lambert.


01:22:07.640 --> 01:22:10.041
I will teach you how to use them.


01:22:28.960 --> 01:22:34.888
- Altera is safe again.
- Safe? What about my ship?


01:22:35.000 --> 01:22:36.764
What about my gold?


01:22:36.880 --> 01:22:40.601
We now have to ride home on an elf ship.


01:22:40.720 --> 01:22:43.883
My worst nightmare, an elf ship!


01:22:44.000 --> 01:22:46.287
Blessings.


01:22:47.680 --> 01:22:48.727
Hey, Varnak!


01:22:57.800 --> 01:23:01.009
Altera is again at peace.


01:23:01.160 --> 01:23:03.925
Such a precious thing, peace...


01:23:05.240 --> 01:23:10.280
for it is easily lost to those
who cherish other things.


01:23:56.400 --> 01:23:59.961
<i>I am the eye of your storm.</i>


01:24:00.080 --> 01:24:02.367
<i>Your lion's roar.</i>


01:24:02.480 --> 01:24:05.086
<i>On the battlefield.</i>


01:24:05.200 --> 01:24:08.488
<i>My love will be your shield.</i>


01:24:08.600 --> 01:24:11.046
<i>No cause for</i> alarm.


01:24:11.160 --> 01:24:14.369
<i>I will come to arms.</i>


01:24:14.480 --> 01:24:16.482
<i>The world could fall.</i>


01:24:16.600 --> 01:24:19.604
<i>We'd still be standing tall.</i>


01:24:19.720 --> 01:24:24.521
<i>And when you think all hope has gone.</i>


01:24:24.640 --> 01:24:29.646
<i>My beating heart will drive you on.</i>


01:24:29.760 --> 01:24:32.445
<i>I will fight for you.</i>


01:24:32.560 --> 01:24:35.325
<i>Give my life to you.</i>


01:24:35.440 --> 01:24:41.163
<i>When you can't see the sky
I will make you fly.</i>


01:24:41.280 --> 01:24:46.923
<i>I'll be dreaming
till I'm no longer breathing.</i>


01:24:47.680 --> 01:24:50.524
<i>Rising from the wreckage.</i>


01:24:50.640 --> 01:24:57.171
<i>Fighting to protect this gem of love.</i>


01:24:57.320 --> 01:25:01.609
<i>You're all I've ever dreamed of.</i>


01:25:01.720 --> 01:25:06.282
<i>So I'm fighting to protect this love.</i>


01:25:08.760 --> 01:25:11.969
<i>Our love is bulletproof.</i>


01:25:12.080 --> 01:25:14.686
<i>There's no breaking through.</i>


01:25:14.880 --> 01:25:17.326
<i>You can take your shot.</i>


01:25:17.440 --> 01:25:20.205
<i>But nothing can stop us.</i>


01:25:20.320 --> 01:25:23.130
<i>I am the moonlight star.</i>


01:25:23.280 --> 01:25:26.090
<i>Reflecting in your heart.</i>


01:25:26.200 --> 01:25:28.771
<i>If you lose the ground.</i>


01:25:28.880 --> 01:25:31.724
<i>I'll never let you down.</i>


01:25:31.840 --> 01:25:38.007
<i>So when you think all hope has gone.</i>


01:25:38.120 --> 01:25:42.045
<i>I will be your secret weapon.</i>


01:25:42.160 --> 01:25:44.766
<i>I will fight for you.</i>


01:25:44.880 --> 01:25:47.611
<i>Give my life to you.</i>


01:25:47.720 --> 01:25:53.489
<i>When you can't see the sky
I will make you fly.</i>


01:25:53.600 --> 01:25:59.209
<i>I'll be dreaming
till I'm no longer breathing.</i>


01:26:00.080 --> 01:26:02.890
<i>Rising from the wreckage.</i>


01:26:03.040 --> 01:26:09.400
<i>Fighting to protect this gem of love.</i>


01:26:09.560 --> 01:26:13.929
<i>You're all I've ever dreamed of.</i>


01:26:14.080 --> 01:26:18.449
<i>So I'm fighting to protect this love.</i>


01:26:18.560 --> 01:26:21.882
<i>This gem of love.</i>


01:26:22.920 --> 01:26:23.464
<i>Oh-oh-oh.</i>


01:26:30.120 --> 01:26:34.364
<i>This gem of love.</i>


01:26:34.480 --> 01:26:37.404
<i>Oh-oh-oh.</i>


01:26:37.520 --> 01:26:43.368
<i>I'm fighting to protect this love.</i>


01:26:44.520 --> 01:26:46.841
BTI Studios


01:27:09.320 --> 01:27:13.803
Oh, stop it! Stop it!
Come on, you win.


01:27:15.560 --> 01:27:17.961
Hey! Also, I have decided.


01:27:18.120 --> 01:27:23.570
Number One, your new name is Bow.
Number Two, yours is Arrow.

